<section id="registry" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-ivory py-20 md:py-28" data-reveal>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center md:px-8">
		<h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-plum md:text-4xl">
			<span data-strand="en">Registry</span>
			<span data-strand="es">Lista de regalos</span>
		</h2>
		<div class="mx-auto mt-4 h-px w-24 bg-mauve/60" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-brown-soft">
			<span data-strand="en"
				>Your presence is our greatest gift. If you wish to honor us with a present, we have curated a
				small registry of experiences and home pieces in muted autumn tones.</span
			><span data-strand="es"
				>Tu presencia es el mejor regalo. Si deseas hacernos un obsequio, hemos reunido una pequeña lista
				de experiencias y piezas para el hogar en tonos otoñales suaves.</span
			>
		</p>
		<ul class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
			<li>
				<a
					href="https://www.zola.com/registry/jocelynandrene/edit" target="_blank"
					class="inline-flex min-w-[14rem] justify-center rounded-full border border-mauve/30 bg-white px-8 py-3 font-medium text-plum transition hover:border-olive hover:text-olive"
				>
					<span data-strand="en">View placeholder registry</span>
					<span data-strand="es">Ver lista de regalos (placeholder)</span>
				</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a
					href="#"
					class="text-sm text-brown-muted underline-offset-4 hover:text-olive hover:underline"
				>
					<span data-strand="en">Honeymoon fund (coming soon)</span>
					<span data-strand="es">Fondo de luna de miel (próximamente)</span>
				</a>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>
